  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_01",
      "hash64": "EA9DF8A57A95E017",
      "text": "He, du da! Stehengeblieben![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_01",
      "hash64": "C01FE0B0C3FE6700",
      "text": "Hinter uns befindet sich das Versteck von\\nTeam Stars Unlicht-Mitgliedern. Wir sind auch\\r\\nbekannt als die Segin-Bande.[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_02",
      "hash64": "EA9DF9A57A95E1CA",
      "text": "Genau! Und wir lassen mit Sicherheit keine\\ndahergelaufene Pappnase wie dich einfach so\\r\\nreinspazieren![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_02",
      "hash64": "C01FE3B0C3FE6C19",
      "text": "Es tut mir furchtbar leid, aber wenn du nicht\\numkehrst, könnte es ungemütlich für dich werden.[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_03",
      "hash64": "EA9DFAA57A95E37D",
      "text": "Äh, Moment mal... Du bist doch nicht etwa [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0506,0000)]dieserdiese\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)], oder...?[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0506",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_04",
      "hash64": "EA9DF3A57A95D798",
      "text": "Diese Knalltüte, die sich mit Team Star angelegt\\nhat und auf die wir es jetzt abgesehen haben?[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "8681C990FFF42607",
      "text": "Kann sein...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "8681CA90FFF427BA",
      "text": "Nein, ich doch nicht!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_03",
      "hash64": "C01FE2B0C3FE6A66",
      "text": "Du... gibst es also zu...? Damit hätte ich jetzt\\nnicht gerechnet.[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_04",
      "hash64": "C01FE5B0C3FE6F7F",
      "text": "Ha, genau das würde jemand sagen, der nicht\\nauffallen will![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_05",
      "hash64": "EA9DF4A57A95D94B",
      "text": "Mir is’ schnuppe, wer du bist. Hier kommste nicht\\nrein! Hau ab oder verlier gegen mich![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "8681CB90FFF4296D",
      "text": "Ich werde gewinnen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "8681C490FFF41D88",
      "text": "Ich geh ja schon...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_05",
      "hash64": "C01FE4B0C3FE6DCC",
      "text": "Dann mach dich mal zügig davon. Hasta la vistar![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_06",
      "hash64": "EA9DF5A57A95DAFE",
      "text": "Graaah!! So was von respektlos! Komm her,\\ndafür gibt’s ’ne Lektion von mir![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_07",
      "hash64": "EA9DF6A57A95DCB1",
      "text": "Argh! Wie konnte ich das versemmeln?![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_08",
      "hash64": "EA9DEFA57A95D0CC",
      "text": "Ab hier übernimmst dann wohl du, Kumpel.[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_09",
      "hash64": "EA9DF0A57A95D27F",
      "text": "Pasta la vistar![VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_06",
      "hash64": "C01FE7B0C3FE72E5",
      "text": "„Hasta“ la vistar...[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_07",
      "hash64": "C01FE6B0C3FE7132",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_08",
      "hash64": "C01FE9B0C3FE764B",
      "text": "Sie ist erst kürzlich zum Team gestoßen und muss\\nnoch etwas an ihrer Einstellung arbeiten...[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_09",
      "hash64": "C01FE8B0C3FE7498",
      "text": "*seufz*[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_10",
      "hash64": "C01C7BB0C3FB858A",
      "text": "Na dann. Ich gehe jetzt besser ins Versteck zurück\\nund warne die anderen...[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_11",
      "hash64": "C01C7CB0C3FB873D",
      "text": "Sie werden mit voller Kraft auf dich losgehen,\\nwenn du deinen Angriff wirklich durchziehst.\\r\\nViel Glück, egal, was du letztendlich machst![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_12",
      "hash64": "C01C79B0C3FB8224",
      "text": "Hasta la vistar![VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
